---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="mt-24 border-t border-[var(--color-border)] bg-[oklch(0.07_0.015_260)]">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-[1280px] px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-10">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-8">
      <div class="md:col-span-5">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
          <div class="size-8 rounded-lg bg-gradient-to-br from-[oklch(0.62_0.22_275)] to-[oklch(0.70_0.18_320)] grid place-items-center text-white font-black text-[13px]">n0</div>
          <span class="font-[700] tracking-[-0.02em]">n0ai.cloud</span>
          <span class="text-[11px] px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-white text-black font-[700] tracking-wider">NEWS & BLOG</span>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-3 text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-[var(--color-text-muted)] max-w-[420px]">
          Tin tức & blog công nghệ, AI, kinh tế — cập nhật tự động hằng ngày, biên tập bởi AI + editor. Chuẩn SEO · GEO · AEO · SDO, tốc độ 100/100.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-4 flex gap-2 text-[12px] text-[var(--color-text-faint)]">
          <a href="/llms.txt" class="hover:text-white underline underline-offset-4">llms.txt</a> ·
          <a href="/rss.xml" class="hover:text-white underline underline-offset-4">RSS</a> ·
          <a href="/sitemap-index.xml" class="hover:text-white underline underline-offset-4">Sitemap</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="md:col-span-7 grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-8 text-[13px]">
        <div>
          <div class="font-[600] tracking-[-0.01em] mb-3">Chuyên mục</div>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-[var(--color-text-muted)]">
            <li><a href="/news" class="hover:text-white">Tin nhanh 24h</a></li>
            <li><a href="/blog" class="hover:text-white">Blog AI & Công nghệ</a></li>
            <li><a href="/topics/kinh-te" class="hover:text-white">Kinh tế</a></li>
            <li><a href="/topics/doi-song" class="hover:text-white">Đời sống</a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="font-[600] tracking-[-0.01em] mb-3">Hệ sinh thái</div>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-[var(--color-text-muted)]">
            <li><a href="https://mail.n0ai.cloud" class="hover:text-white">Mail n0ai</a></li>
            <li><a href="https://luuvan.site" class="hover:text-white">luuvan.site</a></li>
            <li><a href="/about" class="hover:text-white">Về chúng tôi</a></li>
            <li><a href="/contact" class="hover:text-white">Liên hệ</a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="font-[600] tracking-[-0.01em] mb-3">Pháp lý</div>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-[var(--color-text-muted)]">
            <li><a href="/privacy" class="hover:text-white">Privacy</a></li>
            <li><a href="/terms" class="hover:text-white">Terms</a></li>
            <li><a href="/disclaimer" class="hover:text-white">Miễn trừ & Nguồn</a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-10 pt-6 border-t border-[var(--color-border)] flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-between gap-3 text-[12px] text-[var(--color-text-faint)]">
      <span>© {year} n0ai.cloud · Crafted for 100/100 PageSpeed · E-E-A-T verified</span>
      <span>Tự động cập nhật hằng ngày · Mỗi bài có nguồn & kiểm chứng</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
